Network equipment: switches, access points and routers

Usage:
  olr network [command]

Available Commands:
  add         Add managed network equipment
  rm          Forget managed network equipment
  set         Execute a confirmed equipment operation
  show        Inspect network equipment

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for network

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr network [command] --help" for more information about a command.
